@.str.612 = private unnamed_addr constant [265 x i8] c" facilitates switching mode of operation for testing output streams.\0A\0AThis parameter serves no particular purpose within the framework itself. It can be used by test modules relying on output_test_stream to implement testing logic. Default mode is 'match' (false).\00", align 1
